      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokelo Kakan ma Cikirok pa Were to joketho i wema mere ma Daudi oyido ogero; aka jomiyo Rwoth cowirok awaŋa kodi ma siem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo Daudi otieko miyo cowirok, omiyo ji silwany i nyingi Rwoth pa lwak Jolweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi opoko ji je, Joisiraili je, mon gi cwo, kisi nyatoro mugat gi muma riŋo abula, gi nyingi vini m'othwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oyero Jolevi mogo telo lamo Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili, ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok, ka jowero aka jopako go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaf oyido obedo jatel, aka Zekaria oyido konyo go. Jeyel, Semiramoth, Yehiel, Matithia, Eliab, Benaya, Obed Edom kodi Jeyel oyido jotuko tongol. Asaf oyido goyo ndara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jocway ri Were i wi migam ario, Benaya kodi Yahaziel oyido jokudho gwara kisi ndelo ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no Daudi omiyo Asaf kodi Jolevi man silwany marapena wero pak ri Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wer ma Pak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lamo i Yerusalem kodi i Gibeon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo kere Daudi oketho Asaf kodi Jolevi wadi telo lamo ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok ma swa. Oyido joripo timo tic pajo kisi ndelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed Edom wod pa Yeduthun kodi jonono pere; cwo piero aucel g'aboro oyido jokonyo jo. Hosa kodi Obed Edom oyido jokuro waŋkac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zadok jacway ri Were i wi migam kodi wadi, oyido jotelo lamo Rwoth i kalamo i Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi odikin kodi othieno oyido joripo waŋo cowirok gikululu i wi migam paka ondikere i Cik ma Rwoth omiyo Joisiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heman, Yeduthun kodi ji man oyido oyer jo wero wer ma pak ri Rwoth ro mar pere makirum.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
